    "Details": "More of a 'what was on hand' refit of a SLDF-era Mech, this Steel Viper unit was made as a last hope reinforcement that never saw the light of day. Equipped with Clan spec gear and pre-Clan weaponry, it is a hodge podge of technology that would be a nightmare to keep working. Even in the Inner Sphere, this thing would be a rarity to encounter.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.24</color></b>",
